[00:13.00] M: So meet me where the river meets the sea
[00:17.00] F: I'll be the one who's waiting there for you
[00:21.00] D: Together we will sail beyond the tide
[00:25.00] M: No storm can pull us under {F} not tonight
[00:29.00]
